        <mxCell id="notes" value="IMPLEMENTATION RULES&#10;Financial: Decimal totals; gross margin is a ratio, None at zero revenue; ticket is None without sales.&#10;Products: group by company-scoped ID; descending quantity/revenue rankings with ascending ID ties.&#10;AnalysisResult: typed frozen records replace dict/DataFrame. TemporalAnalysis and ChartService remain planned.&#10;Forecasting is separate: calendar trend, chronological holdout, training-only baseline, full-history refit for future dates.&#10;Missing days require explicit zero policy; aware timestamps require a common timezone. See README for contracts and limitations." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#243247;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="990" width="1460" height="180" />
        </mxCell>
